dgxtop (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add process monitoring sorted by CPU, memory, read IO, or write IO
  * Implement configurable alerting thresholds for CPU, Memory, GPU, and Disk await times
  * Add configuration file support (~/.config/dgxtop/config.json)
  * Create systemd system & user level service options with autostart daemon
  * Add network interface specific filtering and history monitoring
  * Enable performance statistics logging to local log files with auto-rotation

